   "updated_at": "2026-11-11T21:07:01Z",
   "body": "/claim cloud/lot-188-opus\n\nPlan (branch `lot/188-theme-engine`, reviewer Fable):\n- **Engine + tokens**: `theme.json` model (THEMES.md §3, every token per variant), decoded from `App/SwiftHFR/Themes/<id>/`, resolved per appearance, exposed through the environment and the reader's CSS variables; new device-scope `SettingKey` `theme_id`, unknown id → Legacy (left in the store). Legacy = no token override: today's LOT-121/122 look, one structure per appearance.\n- **Contrast test**: every bundled `theme.json` decoded and checked against the §3 ratios; a broken fixture theme fails it.\n- **Gallery** (adjusted per the 2026-11-11 note): one theme list section in Réglages › Thème (family, swatches, name, « par <auteur> », check mark, footer), built as a standalone view so #420 (LOT-180) can move it into its « Thème » sub-menu with previews instead of building a second gallery. Spec `docs/lots/LOT-188-theme-engine.md` records the token model the LOT-191/192/193 themes rely on.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
