   "updated_at": "2026-11-12T04:19:26Z",
   "body": "**Operator decision (2026-11-12): option (a).** LOT-188 keeps its scope: themed backgrounds, tint, prominent buttons, unread capsule and reader. Native list rows, separators, selection and native text keep the system colours in this lot.\n\nThe rest is in **#842**: themes recolour native rows and text, blocked by #836 (refactor review 3/3) so that it lands once in the shared list component, and by #829. LOT-192 (#733) and LOT-193 (#734) need it.\n\nNext on PR #829: replace \"operator decision pending\" in `docs/THEMES.md` and `docs/lots/LOT-188-theme-engine.md` with this decision and #842. Then the final CI run, once #801 makes the App job green again.\n\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
